    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Order line vs Quote line variance on amendment deals (same as ORD-FOR-002 but on amendment scenarios).
Why it matters: Amendments are where Q↔O variance most often slips through — partial swaps, mid-term changes, and complex proration produce mismatches. Direct revenue leakage at amendment time.
Suppress a finding: when the variance is approved and documented.
Disable the detector: only if you don&apos;t process amendments. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
